<div class="mandarin-pinyin">fànguǎn</div>

''Meaning:'' restaurant  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
那家饭馆的面条很好吃。 — Nà jiā fànguǎn de miàntiáo hěn hǎochī. — The noodles at that restaurant are delicious.

!! Usage note
Do not merge with 饭店, which has broader regional and contextual uses.
